      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Massieville%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Massieville is home to Ohio’s only Revolutionary War fort, Fort Laurens, a relic of the frontier era.",
